{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-07-13 16:15:00', 'title': 'DESTACO INTRODUCES 82L-3E SERIES POWER CLAMPS', 'text': 'NEW DESIGN FEATURES CLAMPING-ARM OPENING ANGLES THAT ARE ADJUSTABLE UP TO 105° DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JULY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DESTACO, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE INTRODUCTION OF ITS NEW 82L-3E SERIES POWER CLAMPS, WHICH FEATURE LIGHTWEIGHT, ENCLOSED ALUMINUM HOUSING AND OPTIMIZED MECHANICS THAT ARE MORE PRECISE AND SIGNIFICANTLY LONGER-LASTING THAN PREVIOUS POWER-CLAMP DESIGNS.'}